{'symbol': 'HSY', 'date': '2021-11-10 08:30:00', 'title': "HERSHEY ANNOUNCES INTENT TO ACQUIRE DOT'S HOMESTYLE PRETZELS AND PRETZELS INC.", 'text': "HERSHEY, PA., NOV. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HERSHEY COMPANY (NYSE:\xa0HSY) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE\xa0DOT'S PRETZELS LLC, THE OWNER OF DOT'S HOMESTYLE PRETZELS, THE FASTEST-GROWING SCALE 1 \xa0BRAND IN THE PRETZEL CATEGORY."}